{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>Vessels of silver and vessels of gold and garments.</b> What is mentioned later in the verse is more esteemed than its fellow: gold is more esteemed than silver, and the garments are more esteemed than gold. And so it is written (Genesis 12:1): ״מארצך וממולדתך ומבית אביך״ — the father's house is more esteemed than the land of his birth."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:58:15.258406191Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}